<title>SWEDEN: Ave yld on Swedish 9-yr bond auction 6.53 pct.</title>
<headline>Ave yld on Swedish 9-yr bond auction 6.53 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield on an auction of 2.0 billion crowns of nine-year Swedish bonds was 6.53 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>						Loan 1038</p>
<p> Volume issued (billions)		2.00</p>
<p> Total bids    (billions)	     10.43</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids		 2</p>
<p> Number of bids			   60</p>
<p> Lowest yields			     6.519</p>
<p> Highest yields			    6.529</p>
<p> Weighted average yield		  6.528</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
